#
# Third-party 3D models, and nothing in here is committed.
#
# The part manufacturers draw these; EasyEDA, LCSC and the vendors' own
# sites serve them for use in a design, which is not the same as a
# licence to redistribute them - and this repository is public.  So the
# footprints refer to them and the geometry stays out.
#
# KiCad does not render a model it cannot find, and does not error, so a
# clone gets a 3D view missing those parts rather than anything broken.
# To fill it in, fetch each part's STEP from its LCSC page or from the
# manufacturer and drop it here under the name the footprint asks for -
# grep for 'model' in the .kicad_mod to see which name that is.
#
external/
